<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 60,245.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks fall to 60,245.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of August 27 totaled 60,245 bales, down from 62,094 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 753 decertification orders, 1,849 cancellations, and no bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
